	(text "Problem 4.2 / 4.4a - baffled piston (S = 100 cm^2, M_mp = 20 g), baffle tube d = 2 cm, closed box V = 40 l; f = 1 N"
		(at 15.24 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "81d70e71-89fc-4fbe-ad0c-b02e11e89669")
	)
	(text "Top: MOBILITY block (u = V, f = I). Bottom: IMPEDANCE block (loop current = u, R6 = 1 uOhm sense for the F-source trick). Both must agree (4.4a)."
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9e2b9ea8-49f7-4eef-ac4f-e44036422eda")
	)
	(text "Z_Af (a = 5.64 cm): M_A1 = 5.65, R_A2 = 4.06e+04, R_A1 = 1.79e+04, C_A1 = 7.64e-09; tube M_Ad = 2.36; box C_AB = 2.86e-07"
		(at 15.24 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5dde6fee-335a-46c0-8bee-deceb9da6a97")
	)
	(text "Referred to mech: air load S^2*M_A1 = 0.57 g, tube 0.24 g, box compliance C_AB/S^2 = 2.86 mm/N -> f0 = 20.6 Hz"
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e5511e78-6e10-4ff6-a764-d1fdd7894981")
	)
	(text "Damped ONLY by the front radiation resistance -> very high Q at 20 Hz (Re Z_rad ~ (ka)^2). E1 = -S*pi (rot 180 flips polarity: C- = pi, C+ = gnd)"
